  "prompt": "How much MRR did each segment lose to churn in 2024 and 2025 (event_date from 1 January 2024 to 31 December 2025)? Add up the churn events' mrr_delta_local and report the loss as a positive amount in euros, rounded to 2 decimals with ROUND. Convert every amount to euros at one fixed rate, that of 31 December 2025: multiply by fx_rates.eur_per_unit for the subscription's currency on 2025-12-31. Return two columns, in this order: segment and churned_mrr. Return one row for each segment with churn in that time. Any row order is fine.",
